Third-party notices for sc55d
=============================

sc55d links against, and carries patches for, the Nuked-SC55 emulation core.
The core is not included in this repository -- it is a git submodule pointing
at https://github.com/jcmoyer/Nuked-SC55, a fork of nukeykt's Nuked-SC55 -- but
the patches under patches/ contain excerpts of its source as diff context, and
any binary built from this repository contains the core.

The core's licence therefore applies to those patches and to any such binary.
Its terms are reproduced below in full, as that licence requires.

